<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>CYP1A2 유전자 변이별 카페인 대사 특성 비교</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Pretendard', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, system-ui, Roboto, sans-serif; }
    body { background-color: #f8fafc; color: #1e293b; padding: 20px; line-height: 1.6; }
    .container { max-width: 950px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
    
    h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 8px; font-weight: 700; }
    p.subtitle { font-size: 0.95rem; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 24px; }

    /* 유전자형 선택 탭 (4개 항목) */
    .genotype-selector { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .genotype-btn { padding: 12px; border: 2px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 12px; background: #fff; cursor: pointer; text-align: center; transition: all 0.2s; }
    .genotype-btn:hover { border-color: #cbd5e1; }
    .genotype-btn.active { border-color: #2563eb; background: #eff6ff; }
    .genotype-btn .title { font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #1e293b; }
    .genotype-btn.active .title { color: #2563eb; }
    .genotype-btn .sub { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #64748b; margin-top: 2px; }

    /* 비교 카드 그리드 */
    .comparison-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .card { background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; }
    .card-title { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #64748b; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .card-value { font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; }
    .badge { display: inline-block; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 8px; }
    .badge-fast { background: #dcfce7; color: #15803d; }
    .badge-slow { background: #fef3c7; color: #b45309; }
    .badge-critical { background: #fee2e2; color: #991b1b; }

    /* 시각화 프로그래스 바 */
    .viz-section { background: #f1f5f9; padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .bar-group { margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .bar-group:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .bar-label { font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
    .bar-container { height: 12px; background: #e2e8f0; border-radius: 6px; overflow: hidden; }
    .bar-fill { height: 100%; transition: width 0.4s ease; border-radius: 6px; }
    .fill-fast { background: #22c55e; }
    .fill-slow { background: #f59e0b; }
    .fill-critical { background: #ef4444; }

    /* 세부 특징 안내 */
    .detail-box { border-left: 4px solid #2563eb; background: #eff6ff; padding: 16px; border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0; }
    .detail-box h3 { font-size: 1rem; color: #1e3a8a; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .detail-box ul { list-style: none; padding-left: 0; }
    .detail-box li { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #1e40af; margin-bottom: 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
    .detail-box li::before { content: "•"; font-weight: bold; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
  <h1>CYP1A2 유전자 변이별 카페인 대사 특성 비교</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">rs762551 및 I386F, R281W 등 주요 유전자형에 따른 효소 활성 및 카페인 대사 특성 분석</p>

  <!-- 유전자형 선택 버튼 (4가지) -->
  <div class="genotype-selector">
    <div class="genotype-btn active" onclick="selectGenotype('fast')">
      <div class="title">AA 형 (빠른 대사형)</div>
      <div class="sub">rs762551 (A/A)</div>
    </div>
    <div class="genotype-btn" onclick="selectGenotype('slow')">
      <div class="title">AC / CC 형 (느린 대사형)</div>
      <div class="sub">rs762551 (A/C 또는 C/C)</div>
    </div>
    <div class="genotype-btn" onclick="selectGenotype('i386f')">
      <div class="title">I386F 변이형</div>
      <div class="sub">이소류신 → 페닐알라닌</div>
    </div>
    <div class="genotype-btn" onclick="selectGenotype('r281w')">
      <div class="title">R281W 변이형</div>
      <div class="sub">아르기닌 → 트립토판</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 핵심지표 비교 카드 -->
  <div class="comparison-grid">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title">카페인 반감기 (t½)</div>
      <div class="card-value" id="halfLifeText">약 3 ~ 4 시간</div>
      <span class="badge badge-fast" id="halfLifeBadge">빠른 분해</span>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title">효소 활성도 (CYP1A2)</div>
      <div class="card-value" id="activityText">높음 (High)</div>
      <span class="badge badge-fast" id="activityBadge">정상/항진</span>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title">수면 및 심혈관 민감도</div>
      <div class="card-value" id="sensitivityText">낮음</div>
      <span class="badge badge-fast" id="sensitivityBadge">부작용 위험 낮음</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 대사 속도 및 혈중 잔류 시각화 -->
  <div class="viz-section">
    <div class="bar-group">
      <div class="bar-label">
        <span>간 내 카페인 분해 속도 (Clearance Rate)</span>
        <span id="ratePercent">100% (기준)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="bar-container">
        <div class="bar-fill fill-fast" id="rateBar" style="width: 90%;"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="bar-group">
      <div class="bar-label">
        <span>섭취 6시간 후 체내 잔류 카페인 비율</span>
        <span id="residualPercent">약 25 ~ 30%</span>
      </div>
      <div class="bar-container">
        <div class="bar-fill fill-fast" id="residualBar" style="width: 28%;"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 상세 특징 기술 -->
  <div class="detail-box">
    <h3 id="detailTitle">AA형 (빠른 대사형) 주요 특징</h3>
    <ul
